  (text "DATASHEET: L201 = Wurth 74437636351002, 10uH; 2 plated slots per drawing001.000 (2025-02-07)." 
    (at 12.7 337.82 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "17b4740c-8117-5608-b98f-f3ca2c229561")) 
  (text "CALCULATED: 100k / 24.4k local feedback = 5.098361 V nominal. No remote sense or setpoint increase." 
    (at 12.7 342.9 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "6b50d8d1-d9a6-5c66-ab60-f94babd75d2b")) 
  (text "JP201 separates native BUCK_SW from L201_IN. Remove while unpowered for independent fixture isolation / injection." 
    (at 12.7 347.98 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "01d0c104-0e90-5e02-a529-65a946c440e5")) 
  (text "JP202 = IL201_FORCE after the winding, before all raw capacitance. PF2 VIN_PROTECTED / PF3 BUCK_SW / PF4 L201_IN = M4 force pads." 
    (at 12.7 353.06 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "57a012a6-5e64-5c89-b564-c3cc72aeb35f")) 
  (text "C205 bootstrap return stays on native BUCK_SW. TP201 / TP202 paired return pads are sense only." 
    (at 12.7 358.14 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "95bc4410-b502-5238-8692-ae795d54b04f")) 
  (text "ASSUMED qualification box: total local input C 10–30uF; Ldiff 5–12uH through 100A. These are not manufacturer guarantees." 
    (at 12.7 363.22 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "b2e41e15-e6c4-5771-a356-88606e593727")) 
  (text "OPEN: nonlinear magnetic behavior, biased capacitance, startup/inrush, loop stability, ripple and thermal limits." 
    (at 12.7 368.3 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "4633a315-fc92-5062-bb0d-c792dd51e07e")) 
  (text "TEST HOOK — design proven on bench; evidence NOT RUN. Dummy load only; isolated coupons before integrated faults." 
    (at 12.7 373.38 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "23bdb41e-3866-5752-9dc9-6cfb7b355943")))
